{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2d19c3ba8ab6087f956858a2c7a6a87aef81658a84417ea20c5ee57e40993de7", "ja": "（節分イベントのリハーサルが終わった。\n……杏奈は、どこに行ったんだろう？）", "zh": "（节分活动的彩排结束了。……杏奈去哪儿了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "4cc181ec7b711bb6554b2b59a18bfd1a9623fb5b39f9e491b38645ff0e946ae7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん……。\nちょっとだけ、相談……いい、ですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……。\n可以稍微……商量一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ec0df9601fe5b6e8abce6151c5383f4c965d753904a730160a591eaf94e35148", "ja": "杏奈、ここにいたのか。\n大丈夫だけど……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "杏奈，你在这里啊。  \n我没事……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "d8c68c2df524f0d7739a42d8ac7fd747c2cc2a9812d3bbff5fca135ab61a2057", "ja": "うん、あのね……杏奈、節分イベントの、鬼役……\nうまく、できなくて……困ってる、の……。", "zh": "嗯，那个……杏奈演不好……\n节分活动的恶鬼角色……不知道该怎么办才好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1004_p", "source_sha256": "18aab809f4120d7e6baa8e900529b6429a0fb5c41ff1df168cf886cf2b867363", "ja": "え？　でも、杏奈の得意なアクションゲームとそっくり\nだから、絶対勝つって……気合い入ってなかったか？", "zh": "咦？可是，这和杏奈擅长的动作游戏很像，所以你不是还干劲十足地说一定会赢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "5fb1ffab070bb9bad846a9f43f9f86c8d6b084a22fa785d1fbd0213f57d78f20", "ja": "うん……。杏奈、アクションゲームは……得意。\n鬼役も、カッコイイから……勝ちたい。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈……擅长动作游戏。\n抓人的一方也很帅气……所以想赢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "73c68e74bc8daf006be3dfa0dfbb499ffcd2cf2c8e4666d992163ed73a42eeff", "ja": "でも……ゲームの、キャラは、動かせるけど……杏奈、\nゲームみたいな、すごいアクション……できない……。", "zh": "可是……游戏里的角色，虽然能操控……杏奈，做不到游戏里那样厉害的动作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1eb24b9eb0e1346a3d6867b3f7caec62ba58dfe923d8c01257a18b82fe368fd4", "ja": "なるほど。ゲームみたいにやろうとしたら、\n現実の体のほうがついてこなかったのか……。", "zh": "原来如此。想要像游戏里那样行动，结果现实中的身体跟不上吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "c51ebcd23505555aaea89c78d405b7cb7144f9231ed3b8eedd2e37d529afb62c", "ja": "どうしよう、{$P$}さん……\nこのままじゃ……杏奈、勝てないかも……。", "zh": "怎么办，{$P$}先生……\n这样下去的话……杏奈可能赢不了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1009_p", "source_sha256": "357d4788dd573af13077c65955df0daa20ebcb0d7433c694e5347da412e20bf4", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。そのゲームって、\n派手なアクションがないと絶対に勝てないのか？", "zh": "嗯——确实……那个游戏如果没有华丽的动作，就绝对赢不了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "a0d8451234968a9641105bdf2df7ac61db2f6ae5fbc2d5869da4230695bf97e2", "ja": "ううん……絶対じゃ、ない……。\n戦略次第で、動きは少なくても……勝てるの。", "zh": "不是……不是绝对的……\n只要讲究策略，就算动作少……也能赢的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "11d258f7617fbbaa174132cd2a5a41e65fed24676f1918c6cb049a268ca153bf", "ja": "たとえば、相手の裏をかいて……\nあえて動かない、ってことも……あ。", "zh": "比如出其不意地……\n故意按兵不动，也是一种策略……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1012_p", "source_sha256": "01dce2b0eaa234a22a79a1212aef8a81251f4fab5bcc02754e3e2ac5f61e9164", "ja": "つまり、勝つために\n派手なアクションは必要ないって事だな。", "zh": "也就是说，为了获胜，并不需要华丽的操作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "06c8203f9b768d3647dbcceed2fa511b27cdfe350c20d032fe72d7103292488c", "ja": "そう、だね……派手なアクション、より……\nゲームでの、立ち回りのほうが……大事……。", "zh": "对……没错……比起华丽的动作……\n在游戏里的行动方式……更重要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "1b8ef3b57121e7dabfdf6607ecab79a93a9614b745d7f6676ade40e713bcb6c3", "ja": "杏奈……大事なこと、忘れてました……。", "zh": "杏奈……忘了件重要的事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1015_p", "source_sha256": "29b36e4d6b64c1b3f7188346f98a044e92a78a70b83427d1ee763c6ba98bb629", "ja": "始まる前に思い出せて良かったじゃないか。\nこれで、本番もいけそうだな？", "zh": "能在开始前想起来不是挺好的嘛。\n这样一来，正式演出应该也没问题了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "a643cc321039f90fd7430303cf6d8b6eb4aeedf4eaa9a8c380d82fc9dcf3e160", "ja": "うん……。{$P$}さん……\n話、聞いてくれて……ありがと……です。", "zh": "嗯……。{$P$}先生……谢谢你愿意听我说……谢谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "7e1fa1be5684f80362ddc270b361dca913c4d9c7f230d21292368c3b5b2b20ae", "ja": "杏奈……みんなの裏、かいてみせるから……。\nカッコイイところ、見ててほしい……です。", "zh": "杏奈……会出其不意地打败大家给你看的……。\n希望你能看着杏奈帅气的表现……哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6223eef9c82653e6e79173e17962d4f6dc50d4c0967c6aa681f7a0293f695b3d", "ja": "ああ。杏奈が華麗な立ち回りで\n見事に勝つところ、楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "啊。我很期待看到杏奈凭借华丽的战斗技巧漂亮地获胜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0153_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "6ba284d139cb5a381f3ef73bdf4de8efaaecb7396c0750035b4e7d3db38e6b1b", "ja": "うん……。杏奈……がんばり、ます……♪", "zh": "嗯……。杏奈……会努力、的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
